=== Conclusion (WR-03) ===
Post-fix, the fixture's full byte-identical-reproducibility claim no longer
depends on which day the comparison is re-run: harvested_at (the only
non-reproducible field) was dropped from meta entirely, not merely worked
around. The remaining meta keys (kb, split, pool, seed, sample_size,
sampled_from_n, stark_qa_version, hf_revision, harvest_script) and pairs were
already deterministic (raw/harvest-determinism.log) and remain so here.
